# Research source material is not versioned. See decisions/0004.
#
# The media in research/ is third-party and copyrighted — Libbrecht holds copyright on the
# snowcrystals.com videos and excludes internet publication without permission. Committing it
# would publish it on the first push to any remote, and git history would make that permanent.
#
# The source indexes and media inventory stay tracked: together they carry citations plus the
# registered cache paths, byte sizes, and SHA-256 values. The bytes are a private cache; the
# provenance and inventory are the record.
research/*
!research/*.md
# Per-file manifest of the media cache (paths, sizes, sha256 only — no third-party content).
# The prose .md indexes above summarise the tree; they do not enumerate it, so on their own
# they cannot tell a fresh worktree what is missing or verify what it has. Generated by
# scripts/gutcheck-research-inventory.mjs; see docs/local-assets.md.
!research/media-inventory.json
# Our own machine-readable index (annotations + citations, no copyrighted media) — tracked
# alongside its .md twin. See research/lab-validation-dataset.md.
!research/lab-validation-dataset.jsonl
# Phase 8's own canonical target book (annotations and citations only, no source media).
!research/phase8-target-book.jsonl
# Our own Phase 8B registered plot operators (metadata only; no source media or coordinates).
!research/phase8b-plot-operator-v1.json
!research/phase8b-plot-operator-v2.json
!research/phase8b-plot-publication-v3.json
# Our own Phase 6 source-lock metadata and extracted observations; contains no third-party media.
!research/phase6-heldout-candidate-lock.json
# Exact maker-rejected WP1 V4/V4.x history; retained as records, never executable authority.
!research/rejected/
research/rejected/*
!research/rejected/phase6-wp1-v4x/
!research/rejected/phase6-wp1-v4x/phase6-source-currency-v4x-rejected.md
!research/rejected/phase6-wp1-v4x/phase6-wp1-independence-operands.json
!research/rejected/phase6-wp1-v4x/phase6-wp1-review-findings.json
!research/rejected/phase6-wp1-v4x/phase6-wp1-search-registry.json

# Workspace tooling (Phase 2 scaffold)
node_modules/

# Host metadata and disposable repository-local scratch.
.DS_Store
/tmp/

# In-repository scratch worktrees, isolated evidence repositories, and local debug logs.
# Load-bearing evidence now lives in the TRACKED evidence/ tree (ADR 0038), not here.
/.tmp-*/
/debug.log

# Run outputs: checkpoints, PGM dumps and scratch land in out/ by convention, and NOTHING in it
# is tracked. Treat it as disposable workspace, not a byte-for-byte backup set: durable
# provenance belongs in evidence/, ledgered bulk and archived scratch can be restored from the
# NAS, and transient logs/checks are regenerated or discarded. Anything that BACKS A PUBLISHED
# CLAIM belongs in evidence/ instead (ADR 0038), and the
# gut-check spike's tracked recipes/records/inventory moved to evidence/gutcheck-gg-realism/
# on 2026-08-12 (maker directive: out/ fully temporary), retiring the negation block that
# used to live here. High-level grow-batch, sweep-specs, and archive-pack workflows re-pin that
# subtree; direct or hand writes require `npm run evidence:pin`. Do not reintroduce tracked files
# under out/.
out/**
